{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ESRkdBrwhXs58tsGu4LmFL","type":"tool_result","content":"[open] Issue #16: [realdeal-2026] /account page — entitlements + subscription + profile SSR\n  Author: @luiscipparrone1\n  Status: OPEN\n  URL: https://github.com/synergyio1/locus-landing-page/issues/16\n\n  Description:\n    ## Parent PRD\n    \n    #3\n    \n    ## What to build\n    \n    Replace the `/account` stub from #15 with the real SSR page described in PRD #3 → \"Implementation Decisions\" → Routes → `/account`. Reads `entitlements_v` + `subscriptions` + `profiles` + `pro_trials` for the authenticated user via a single query.\n    \n    Rendered elements:\n    \n    - User email\n    - Plan chip: \"Free\" / \"Trial\" / \"Pro\"\n    - Renewal or expiry date\n    - CTA area with placeholder (disabled) buttons: \"Upgrade to Pro\", \"Manage subscription\", \"Start 7-day Pro trial\" — actual wiring lands in #17, #19, #22 respectively\n    - \"Sign out everywhere\" button (from #15, retained)\n    - Link to `/download`\n    \n    Handle the `cancel_at` state: if subscription has `cancel_at` set and `status = active`, render \"Pro until `<cancel_at>`, will not renew\" in place of the renewal date.\n    \n    ## Acceptance criteria\n    \n    - [ ] `/account` SSR reads entitlement + subscription + profile + pro_trials data in a single round-trip\n    - [ ] Plan chip correctly resolves to Free / Trial / Pro based on `entitlements_v`\n    - [ ] Renewal date shown for active subscriptions; expiry date shown for trial\n    - [ ] Cancelled-but-still-active state renders \"Pro until `<date>`, will not renew\"\n    - [ ] Free user sees \"Upgrade to Pro\" CTA (disabled placeholder in this slice)\n    - [ ] Active Pro user sees \"Manage subscription\" CTA (disabled placeholder in this slice)\n    - [ ] Free user with no trial consumed sees \"Start 7-day Pro trial — Free for 7 days, no card needed\" (disabled placeholder)\n    - [ ] Free user who consumed trial sees \"Trial used on `<date>`\" (disabled)\n    - [ ] Link to `/download` present\n    - [ ] Page redirects to `/login?next=/account` if unauthenticated (verified by middleware from #15)\n    - [ ] Vitest or Playwright coverage for the four rendering states: Free (no trial), Free (trial used), Trial active, Pro active, Pro cancelling\n    \n    ## Blocked by\n    \n    - Blocked by #15\n    - Blocked by external Issue B (billing schema + `entitlements_v` view must exist in Supabase; this slice reads from tables Issue B creates)\n    \n    ## User stories addressed\n    \n    - User story 8\n    - User story 14","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"82165d35-d203-4a92-8a20-2857e59a923f","uuid":"5ee55648-a22c-4d4b-ad53-933687fe0b95","timestamp":"2026-04-26T22:22:03.473Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"[open] Issue #16: [realdeal-2026] /account page — entitlements + subscription + profile SSR\n  Author: @luiscipparrone1\n  Status: OPEN\n  URL: https://github.com/synergyio1/locus-landing-page/issues/16\n\n  Description:\n    ## Parent PRD\n    \n    #3\n    \n    ## What to build\n    \n    Replace the `/account` stub from #15 with the real SSR page described in PRD #3 → \"Implementation Decisions\" → Routes → `/account`. Reads `entitlements_v` + `subscriptions` + `profiles` + `pro_trials` for the authenticated user via a single query.\n    \n    Rendered elements:\n    \n    - User email\n    - Plan chip: \"Free\" / \"Trial\" / \"Pro\"\n    - Renewal or expiry date\n    - CTA area with placeholder (disabled) buttons: \"Upgrade to Pro\", \"Manage subscription\", \"Start 7-day Pro trial\" — actual wiring lands in #17, #19, #22 respectively\n    - \"Sign out everywhere\" button (from #15, retained)\n    - Link to `/download`\n    \n    Handle the `cancel_at` state: if subscription has `cancel_at` set and `status = active`, render \"Pro until `<cancel_at>`, will not renew\" in place of the renewal date.\n    \n    ## Acceptance criteria\n    \n    - [ ] `/account` SSR reads entitlement + subscription + profile + pro_trials data in a single round-trip\n    - [ ] Plan chip correctly resolves to Free / Trial / Pro based on `entitlements_v`\n    - [ ] Renewal date shown for active subscriptions; expiry date shown for trial\n    - [ ] Cancelled-but-still-active state renders \"Pro until `<date>`, will not renew\"\n    - [ ] Free user sees \"Upgrade to Pro\" CTA (disabled placeholder in this slice)\n    - [ ] Active Pro user sees \"Manage subscription\" CTA (disabled placeholder in this slice)\n    - [ ] Free user with no trial consumed sees \"Start 7-day Pro trial — Free for 7 days, no card needed\" (disabled placeholder)\n    - [ ] Free user who consumed trial sees \"Trial used on `<date>`\" (disabled)\n    - [ ] Link to `/download` present\n    - [ ] Page redirects to `/login?next=/account` if unauthenticated (verified by middleware from #15)\n    - [ ] Vitest or Playwright coverage for the four rendering states: Free (no trial), Free (trial used), Trial active, Pro active, Pro cancelling\n    \n    ## Blocked by\n    \n    - Blocked by #15\n    - Blocked by external Issue B (billing schema + `entitlements_v` view must exist in Supabase; this slice reads from tables Issue B creates)\n    \n    ## User stories addressed\n    \n    - User story 8\n    - User story 14","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
